{"id": "EUVD-2026-104282", "enisaUuid": "59e13ec0-301c-3960-9a69-e2c2c821cc89", "description": "Flarum Extension Manager 2.0.0-beta.1 before 2.0.0-beta.8 lacks authentication and admin checks on the TaskResource index endpoint, allowing unauthenticated information disclosure. Remote attackers can send GET requests to /api/extension-manager-tasks to read task output revealing filesystem paths, installed extensions, versions, and PHP version.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T13:55:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T14:18:17", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/flarum/framework/issues/4386", "https://github.com/flarum/framework/commit/257989e71fd8cc7ddab20f31dcde1aa760b1a08f", "https://github.com/flarum/framework/releases/tag/v2.0.0-beta.8", "https://github.com/flarum/framework/blob/v2.0.0-beta.6/extensions/package-manager/src/Api/Resource/TaskResource.php", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/flarum-extension-manager-2.0.0-beta.1-before-2.0.0-beta.8-missing-authorization-via-task-api"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6p4m-p9g8-5x3c", "CVE-2026-112291"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "35784028-af44-31ce-9d95-9200f38178a7", "product": {"name": "Extension Manager", "vendor": {"name": "flarum"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0-beta.1 <2.0.0-beta.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "685c4057-1fcb-33ea-8da3-26feb1c08d0b", "vendor": {"name": "flarum"}}], "isExploited": false}